Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软曝光纯网页版操作系统Project Aion，彻底放弃原生桌面应用支持</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软成立Frontier Company部门，斥资25亿美元派驻6000名工程师</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">不向供应链低头！Meta联手台积电美光让新服务器用上旧内存</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴开源 Page Agent 客户端库，通过 DOM 脱水实现大模型网页自动化控制</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9eb46f19d0f0edf3aabbdff47bbd70cd.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴近日开源了 JavaScript 客户端库 Page Agent，旨在通过“DOM 脱水”技术重构浏览器自动化流程。该方案摒弃了传统依赖 Selenium 或 Playwright 的外部驱动模式，直接在页面内部运行，将实时 DOM 结构压缩为轻量化的 FlatDomTree 纯文本映射。这一创新使大模型无需处理多模态视觉信息，即可精准执行点击、填表等交互指令。Page Agent 采用模型无关设计，兼容所有支持 OpenAI 接口的 LLM，并能无缝继承用户 Cookie 与会话信息，大幅降低了 SaaS AI 副驾及自动化表单处理的开发门槛。目前该项目已在 GitHub 以 MIT 协议开源。开发团队提醒，该库目前聚焦单页面交互，且基于提示词的权限管控并非硬性逻辑隔离，涉及资金划拨等高风险操作时，开</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">快手旗下可灵AI完成30亿美元融资，投后估值达180亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c1efb0bd0418e0b58ef6c0f82c65cf5c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">快手旗下视频生成大模型“可灵AI”正式完成近30亿美元融资，投后估值达到180亿美元，刷新全球视频大模型领域融资规模纪录。本轮融资由CPE源峰、国方创投、BlueFive、腾讯、中关村科学城基金及中信证券联合领投，数十家机构跟投。投资方阵容涵盖阿里云、百度等头部产业资本，以及华策影视、芒果产业投资人等文娱产业方。此次融资标志着可灵AI正式开启独立商业化进程，资金将主要用于后续技术迭代与算力扩容。作为快手AI核心成果，可灵AI通过此次融资完成了从内部技术项目向市场化经营主体的跨越，旨在通过资本加持在激烈的AI视频赛道建立技术与商业壁垒，进一步推动AI技术在内容生产领域的规模化应用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软曝光纯网页版操作系统Project Aion，彻底放弃原生桌面应用支持</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9617c0f31b025a06e786ef59605a3345.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软内部代号为“Project Aion”的全新操作系统近日曝光，该系统完全基于Microsoft Edge浏览器及轻量化网页技术构建，标志着微软向AI原生计算架构的重大转型。Project Aion彻底移除了传统Windows的开始菜单与桌面图标，转而采用极简AI交互界面，由Copilot智能助理主导日常操作。系统引入“空间”概念，支持将网页与应用自动分类归纳，实现多任务高效协同。在生态层面，该系统全面放弃对传统Windows原生桌面应用的支持，所有软件均通过Web端运行，并集成Windows 365远程桌面服务以实现云端过渡。这种轻量化、重云端的架构设计，预示着个人计算设备正从传统本地交互向AI驱动的Web生态演进，将对现有桌面操作系统交互逻辑产生深远影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软成立Frontier Company部门，斥资25亿美元派驻6000名工程师</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a55ba8af0cbaf9ccd059ee8169ea1c8b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软正式成立全新业务部门“Frontier Company”，投入25亿美元预算，旨在加速企业客户的AI转型。该部门计划将6000名资深技术工程师直接派驻至企业客户现场，通过深度嵌入式协作，共同完成系统架构设计、模型部署及业务场景优化，将AI技术指标转化为实际经营成果。微软商业业务首席执行官Judson Althoff表示，此举旨在超越常规的前向部署工程，提供以业务价值为核心的工程服务。微软正联动埃森哲、凯捷、安永、毕马威及普华永道等全球顶尖系统集成商快速铺开服务网络。此举标志着AI行业从模型研发转向落地实效阶段，微软通过构建“现场部署”护城河，试图在OpenAI与Anthropic等竞争对手的部署竞赛中掌握核心话语权，并为企业提供更深度的AI集成服务。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">不向供应链低头！Meta联手台积电美光让新服务器用上旧内存</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0758c9481f9511e26c9b3d45a113797f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta联手台积电美光让新服务器用上旧内存AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jul 3, 202620在人工智能热潮席捲全球的背景下，新一代DDR5 内存正面临极其严重的断货危机。为了不让AI数据中心的建设进度受阻，科技巨头Meta近日联合台积电与美光等行业巨头，成功研发出一种颠覆性的过渡技术。这项技术让原本只能支持DDR5 内存的尖端AI服务器，成功顺畅地运行起旧款的DDR4 内存。这套被戏称为“缝合怪”的系统在实际业务测试中展现出了令人惊叹的稳定性，成功为企业在供应链危机中开辟了一条全新的自救出路。跨越代际的物理鸿沟由于DDR5 与DDR4 在引脚设计、工作电压以及电源管理架构上存在本质区别，实现反向兼容面临着极高的物理和电气障碍。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
